        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-376 (ensure controlled execution — Consignment Inventory Operations (PA-45.1).) | - operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Category Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
