    <bpmn:process id="W_W1933" name="W1933. Consignment Stock Transfer Between Locations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Store requests consignment stock from another store or DC; vendor approves transfer
Frequency: ~20–30 consignment transfers/month
Volume: ~50–100 units/month
Owner: Category Manager
Participants: Category Manager, Store Manager (sending), Store Manager (receiving), Vendor
Source: workflow W1933 — Consignment Stock Transfer Between Locations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1933_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1933_Lane1" name="Category Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1933_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1933_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1933_Lane2" name="Receiving Clerk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1933_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1933_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1933_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1933_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1933_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1933_Start5" name="Store requests consignment stock from another store or DC; vendor approves transfer">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1933_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1933_Task6" name="Category Manager approves consignment transfer: (a) receiving store has…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Category Manager approves consignment transfer: (a) receiving store has customer waiting or strong demand, (b) sending store has excess consignment stock (slow-moving), (c) vendor notified of transfer (consignment agreement may require vendor approval for location changes), (d) transfer order created in system with consignment indicator
Responsible (R): Category Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 15–30 min/transfer</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1933_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1933_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1933_Task7" name="Sending store ships consignment goods: (a) Receiving Clerk packs and ships per…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sending store ships consignment goods: (a) Receiving Clerk packs and ships per standard transfer process, (b) system posts consignment stock-out at sending location (no financial posting — vendor-owned), (c) goods in-transit tracked as consignment in-transit
Responsible (R): Receiving Clerk (sending)
Accountable (A): Store Manager (sending)
Duration: Per standard transfer</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1933_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1933_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1933_Task8" name="Receiving store receives consignment transfer: (a) verify quantity and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Receiving store receives consignment transfer: (a) verify quantity and condition, (b) system posts consignment stock-in at receiving location, (c) vendor consignment balance updated: vendor total unchanged, location allocation changed
Responsible (R): Receiving Clerk (receiving)
Accountable (A): Store Manager (receiving)
Duration: Per standard receipt</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1933_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1933_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1933_Task9" name="Vendor notification: system sends automatic transfer notification to vendor…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Vendor notification: system sends automatic transfer notification to vendor with new location details for their records
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1933_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1933_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1933_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1933_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1933_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-376 (ensure controlled execution — Consignment Inventory Operations (PA-45.1).) | - operational: Category Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Category Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
